#: ../../guide/localization.md:1
msgid "Contributing Translations"
msgstr "Contributing Translations"

#: ../../guide/localization.md:3
msgid "Translations live in the repository next to the code and are contributed by pull request, the same as any other change. There is no translation platform to sign up for."
msgstr "Translations live in the repository next to the code and are contributed by pull request, the same as any other change. There is no translation platform to sign up for."

#: ../../guide/localization.md:5
msgid "There are two independent sets of files: the VS Code extension, which uses flat JSON, and the documentation, which uses gettext `.po` catalogs. Pick whichever you want to work on — they do not depend on each other."
msgstr "There are two independent sets of files: the VS Code extension, which uses flat JSON, and the documentation, which uses gettext `.po` catalogs. Pick whichever you want to work on — they do not depend on each other."

#: ../../guide/localization.md:7
msgid "How to contribute"
msgstr "How to contribute"

#: ../../guide/localization.md:9
msgid "Fork the repository and branch off `main`."
msgstr "Fork the repository and branch off `main`."

#: ../../guide/localization.md:10
msgid "Edit the files described below."
msgstr "Edit the files described below."

#: ../../guide/localization.md:11
msgid "Run `just check-l10n` to verify the extension files are still in sync."
msgstr "Run `just check-l10n` to verify the extension files are still in sync."

#: ../../guide/localization.md:12
msgid "Open a pull request."
msgstr "Open a pull request."

#: ../../guide/localization.md:14
msgid "Partial work is fine. For the documentation, leave `msgstr \"\"` on anything you have not translated and Sphinx falls back to English. For the extension, every key must be present (see [CI Checks](#ci-checks)), so copy the English string as the value for any key you skip."
msgstr "Partial work is fine. For the documentation, leave `msgstr \"\"` on anything you have not translated and Sphinx falls back to English. For the extension, every key must be present (see [CI Checks](#ci-checks)), so copy the English string as the value for any key you skip."

