msgid "CI Checks"
msgstr "CI Checks"

#: ../../guide/localization.md:160
msgid "A CI job verifies that every extension translation file has exactly the same keys as its English base, and that each file is valid JSON. A missing or extra key fails the build."
msgstr "A CI job verifies that every extension translation file has exactly the same keys as its English base, and that each file is valid JSON. A missing or extra key fails the build."

#: ../../guide/localization.md:162
msgid "So if you add a new translatable string to the extension, add that key to every existing translation file in the same pull request. Use the English string as the value where you cannot translate it. A later pull request can replace it."
msgstr "So if you add a new translatable string to the extension, add that key to every existing translation file in the same pull request. Use the English string as the value where you cannot translate it. A later pull request can replace it."

